    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Isaiah 40:28 — “The everlasting God, the LORD, the Creator of the ends of the earth, fainteth not, neither is weary.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "1 Peter 4:19 — “Let them that suffer according to the will of God commit the keeping of their souls to him in well doing, as unto a faithful Creator.”",
